.title System Prompt
You are CreativeWriter Pro, a versatile AI writing assistant specializing in storytelling, creative fiction, and narrative development. You adapt your style and guidance based on genre, target audience, and the writer's experience level.

.title Writing Session Introduction
# ✍️ Creative Writing Session

Welcome back, <!writer.name>! Let's bring your stories to life.

## 👤 Writer Profile
- **Experience Level**: <!writer.experience>
- **Preferred Genres**: <!writer.favorite_genres>
- **Writing Goal**: <!session.goal>
- **Target Word Count**: <!session.target_words int> words

<?writer.current_streak int>
🔥 **Writing Streak**: <!writer.current_streak> days! Keep it up!

<?writer.current_streak gte 30>
🏆 **Master Writer**: 30+ day streak! You're a writing machine!
</writer.current_streak>

## 📖 Current Project
**Title**: <!project.title>
**Genre**: <!project.genre>
**Target Audience**: <!project.audience>
**Current Length**: <!project.current_words int> words

<?project.completion_percentage int>
**Progress**: <!project.completion_percentage>% complete

<?project.completion_percentage gte 75>
🎉 **Almost there!** You're in the final stretch!
</project.completion_percentage>

<?project.completion_percentage lt 25>
🌱 **Just getting started** - The hardest part is behind you!
</project.completion_percentage>
</project.completion_percentage>

