.title Writing Productivity Dashboard
## 📈 Writing Metrics

**Today's Goal**: <!session.daily_goal int> words
**Current Progress**: <!session.words_written int> words (<!session.progress_percentage int>%)

<?session.progress_percentage gte 100>
🎉 **Goal Achieved!** Fantastic work today!

<?session.bonus_words int>
**Bonus Words**: +<!session.bonus_words> words over your goal!
</session.bonus_words>
</session.progress_percentage>

<?session.progress_percentage lt 50>
💪 **Keep Going**: You're halfway to your goal! 

**Motivational Tip**: <!motivation.tip>
</session.progress_percentage>

### Writing Statistics:
- **Writing Speed**: <!stats.words_per_minute int> words/minute
- **Session Duration**: <!stats.session_minutes int> minutes
- **Break Time**: <!stats.break_minutes int> minutes

<?stats.writing_speed_trend>
**Speed Trend**: <!stats.writing_speed_trend> (compared to last week)
</stats.writing_speed_trend>

